doc: the Cloud access page of Settings is drawn for an administrator (read only; skipped when the page is not offered)
clause: 1 Settings > Cloud access is drawn for an administrator with the Tenant members and Namespaces sections
human: cloud-look | Open Settings, Cloud access as an administrator, add a test person, change the role and remove the person. Expect: Each change asks first, shows the result and the page says the keys are to be rotated.
